        "subject_definitions:\n<Picture 1> is the primary visual reference for <Subject 1>, defining the young woman, her red jacket, the autumn park environment, golden light, and overall visual style from the previous clip.\n<Subject 1> is the same young woman in the red jacket in the same autumn park. Keep her appearance, clothing, the park environment, lighting, and color palette consistent with <Picture 1>.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The young woman continues her walk through the autumn park, now reaching a small bridge over a stream. The scene maintains the same golden autumn light and visual style.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - retain the woman appearance, red jacket, autumn park setting, golden lighting, and color palette defined by <Picture 1>.\n<Picture 1>: fully_preserved - use its character design, environment, lighting, and style as the visual anchor.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] The young woman in the red jacket walks along a path in the autumn park, continuing from the previous clip. She approaches a small wooden bridge over a gentle stream. Golden leaves continue to fall. She pauses at the bridge, leans on the railing, and watches the water flow below. The camera follows her in a smooth lateral tracking shot, maintaining the same warm golden-hour lighting and autumn color palette.\n\noverall_soundscape: Gentle stream flowing, rustling leaves, distant birdsong, soft footsteps on wooden bridge.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Warm acoustic guitar melody continues, soft and nostalgic, matching the previous clip.",
