      "widgets_values": [
        "BSAI-ComfyUI_Contextual Series - Standard Workflow Demo\n\nThis workflow demonstrates how to maintain visual consistency across two video clips using MiniMax H3.\n\nStage 1 (top): Generate Clip 1 via Text-to-Video (T2V)\n  - MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo with no first/last frame = T2V mode\n  - Decode latent to IMAGE frames\n  - Save Clip 1\n\nContextual Series (middle):\n  - BSAI_ContextualSeriesExtract extracts the last 15 frames from Clip 1\n  - Subsamples evenly to 9 reference images (H3 API limit)\n  - Outputs IMAGE batch for Stage 2 reference input\n\nStage 2 (bottom): Generate Clip 2 via Reference-to-Video (Ref2V)\n  - MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo uses the 9 reference images\n  - Same character, environment, lighting, and color palette\n  - Save Clip 2\n\nRequired models:\n  - diffusion_models/MiniMax-H3/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n  - text_encoders/MiniMax-H3/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors\n  - vae/MiniMax-H3/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n  - vae/MiniMax-H3/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n  - MiniMaxH3Turbo LoRA (optional, for 4-step fast generation)"
      ],
      "title": "Workflow Instructions",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
